111880","id":3426233205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MOCt1","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T11:57:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T11:57:32Z","body":"@AThousandShips \r\n\r\nAs in description, current physics engine does not support active `StaticBody2D`. So we cannot add `StaticBody2D` to `active_body_list`, so only update `StaticBody2D` layer or mask won't trigger collision. That is the reason.\r\n\r\nThe straight way to fix this issue is allow `StaticBody2D` to be set `active` and added to `active_body_list`, then it can trigger collision by itself.\r\n\r\nIf we dont want fixing issue this way, maybe we need add additional logic for `StaticBody2D`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3426233205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3426312012","html_url":"https://gi