b.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T00:59:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T09:51:52Z","body":"@AThousandShips \r\n\r\nI tested only add `StaticBody2D` to`active_list`, without `active = true`. It can still solve the issue. I think it is better.\r\n\r\n[wakeup.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79eb5f09-cd52-4efd-8fd2-4d836a32188a)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3430069025/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663676299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111880#issuecomment-5663676299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111880","id":5663676299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUZTXiw","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T12:11:31Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T12:11:31Z","body":"I can confirm that the #111823 MRP appears fixed with this PR, and my game works as usual.\r\n\r\nHowever, this PR does print a few of these errors for me:\r\n\r\n`ERROR: Condition \"p_elem->_root\" is true.`\r\n\r\nAlso, I think you need to set `active` as well as adding to the active list, otherwise the static body may not be subsequently removed from the list due to the change guard below:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid GodotBody2D::set_active(bool p_active) {\r\n\tif (active == p_active) {\r\n\t\treturn;\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso, unless I am mistaken, once you wake a static body, it will not be able to sleep again (be removed from the list) until it's whole contact island can go to sleep. If so, that is unnecessary processing, when you only needed it to wake for one frame.\r\n\r\nAlso, it could be more expensive for a body to trigger the narrow phase test than for an area, because the body will form all it's contacts into a larger island (which must be processed serially on a single thread).\r\n\r\nThe PR below fixes the same bug, but by 'waking' the connected areas rather than the static body (I did this before I found your PR).\r\n[Fix area monitoring logic bugs - #121747](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121747)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663676299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663965522","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111880#issuecomment-5663965522","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111880","id":5663965522,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUZlBUg","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T12:31:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T12:31:56Z","body":"@Schnorg\r\nThank you for commenting. Actually, I am a little busy, I am afraid cannot update this PR in the near future.\r\n\r\nIf you have a good solution, please ask someone to review and mark this PR as superseded. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663965522/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]